  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Discover Hidden Attractions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project seeks to increase the attractiveness of underutilized tourism potential of the cross border area, stimulating the arrival of guests and creation of new jobs in the tourism sector. To achieve this, the role of entrepreneurs in tourism development will be enhanced by creating joint 6 new tourist packages covering northern Herzegovina and Danilovgrad/Niksic areas. In parallel, neglected tourist locations in the cross border area more desirable and visible on the tourist market.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
